        "event": "Special Weather Statement",
        "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued June 1 at 3:34PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK",
        "description": "A front approaching the area will continue to bring gusty\nnortheast winds along the Northern Bristol Bay Coast through late\nthis evening. Gusts up to 45 mph, with isolated ones to 55 mph,\nwill persist through late this evening before slowly diminishing\nthrough Tuesday morning.",
